# HOST-BINDING-DAG: {{^}}moduleref 'libc.so.6'{{$}}
# HOST-BINDING-DAG: {{^}}  .method '<msil>dataimport' {{.*$}}
# HOST-BINDING-DAG: {{^}}  .method '<msil>init_dataimports' {{.*$}}
# HOST-BINDING-DAG: {{^}}    L{{[0-9]+}}: ldstr "data import 'stdout' not found in libc.so.6"{{$}}
# HOST-BINDING-DAG: {{^}}    L{{[0-9]+}}: ldstr "data import 'environ' not found in libc.so.6"{{$}}

## Linker options in an msil64 object (D10): '-lm' and '-lmy lib', each one
